  {
    "id": "treasury-department-office-of-management-and-budget-omb",
    "name": "Office of Management and Budget (OMB)",
    "type": "Office",
    "parentId": null,
    "desc": "Pursuant to the Terrorism Risk Insurance Act of 2002, as amended (TRIA), insurers that participate in the Terrorism Risk Insurance Program (TRIP or Program) are directed to submit information for the 2026 TRIP Data Call, which covers the reporting period from January 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025. Participating insurers are required to register and report information in a series of forms approved by the Office of Management and Budget (OMB). All insurers writing commercial property and casualty insurance in lines subject to TRIP, subject to certain exceptions identified in this notice, must respond to this data call no later than May 15, 2026.",
